    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Notice!</h2></strong><br>Due to an operational error during the release, the game was not labeled as an early access game. <br>We apologize for this oversight.<br>Please note that the game is still under development!<br>It is expected that the full game content and CG quantity in the future will be double what is currently available.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955150/extras/fc7db3a215bdd28ccbae6453afb9ae1c.avif?t=1717514434\" width=616 height=89 /></span><br>A crisis has descended upon the village where you live.<br>Following an ancient legend, you embarked on the journey to find the witch.<br>In order to save the village, you had to strike deals with the witch repeatedly.<br>A huge conspiracy buried in history was also uncovered.<br><br><strong>Characters</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955150/extras/ca154f03ec272ac7f417f1940e6685fa.avif?t=1717514434\" width=600 height=326 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955150/extras/ad2bbae139e3a1ddfe6b66e9c68a262c.avif?t=1717514434\" width=600 height=326 /></span><br><br><strong>Upcoming characters in the next update</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955150/extras/7661b5447637a3e18ad24d941a85d954.avif?t=1717514434\" width=600 height=326 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955150/extras/76669e94e9b0fbdd6e2dc04c85cb96b0.avif?t=1717514434\" width=616 height=89 /></span><br><br>\u25c7 Pixel Style with HD CG<br>A blend of traditional pixel art and high-definition CG for an amazing gaming experience!<br><br>\u25c7 Casual Rogue-like Battles<br>Enjoy casual, fun combat with a variety of skill combinations to spice up your adventure!<br><br>\u25c7 Unique Witches<br>Encounter diverse witches on your journey. Get to know their personalities and stories, form deeper bonds, and utilize their powers to save your village!",
