r an amazing gaming experience!<br><br>\u25c7 Casual Rogue-like Battles<br>Enjoy casual, fun combat with a variety of skill combinations to spice up your adventure!<br><br>\u25c7 Unique Witches<br>Encounter diverse witches on your journey. Get to know their personalities and stories, form deeper bonds, and utilize their powers to save your village!",
